# React Components

- Hybrid layout: generic → `components/ui/`; Pokémon → `components/pokemon/`
- Feature components compose from `ui/` — don't reimplement primitives
- Props interfaces named `{Component}Props`
- No fetch, Query, or Zustand inside `ui/` components
- **Every new `components/ui/` file requires a Storybook story** at `stories/{name}.stories.tsx` (e.g. `input.tsx` → `input.stories.tsx`)
- Story title: `UI/{ComponentName}` (PascalCase, e.g. `UI/Button`)
- Minimum: a `Default` story plus meaningful variants/states (disabled, error, type variants)
- Compound components (e.g. `Card`): use a `render` story showing typical composition
- Domain pattern stories optional (e.g. `SearchFilterPattern`, `ListLoadingPattern`) when they document real app usage
- Also add stories for new reusable `components/pokemon/` components
